*secret*
*key*.json
*api-key*
*access-token*
시크리뚜.txt

# Data-supply materialization and runtime locks
!data/yf/etf-details/*.json
# Uppercase Yahoo ticker symbols such as KEYG/KEYX are data identities, not key files.
!data/admin/yahoo-batch-quote-history/tickers/*.json
!data/admin/yahoo-batch-quote-history/lkg/*.json
data/admin/data-supply-state/**/*.lock

